1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,000
[English subtitles are available]

2
00:00:00,570 --> 00:00:02,720
When are you going
to stop lying to yourself?

3
00:00:03,430 --> 00:00:05,140
You know better than anyone.

4
00:00:06,110 --> 00:00:08,270
This is the end of the lie.

5
00:00:08,440 --> 00:00:10,690
But you chose to keep lying to yourself.

6
00:00:10,770 --> 00:00:11,920
Kakarayan.

7
00:00:13,190 --> 00:00:14,470
How much longer are you going to hide

8
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:15,970
behind this lie?

9
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:21,600
Why are you calling me Kakarayan?

10
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:24,110
Don't pretend you don't understand.

11
00:00:25,780 --> 00:00:27,190
You know what I'm talking about.

12
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:32,330
You asked me to keep this secret for you.

13
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:34,270
But you won't even tell me

14
00:00:34,360 --> 00:00:35,990
why you created this lie.

15
00:00:37,830 --> 00:00:39,370
This is how you manipulate me

16
00:00:39,510 --> 00:00:40,910
into foolishly weaving

17
00:00:41,050 --> 00:00:42,630
these impossible dreams for you.

18
00:00:43,470 --> 00:00:44,570
Kakarayan.

19
00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:48,080
Kakarayan.

20
00:00:51,030 --> 00:00:52,660
Don't think just because
you're in the rain,

21
00:00:54,680 --> 00:00:55,960
no one would see

22
00:00:56,050 --> 00:00:58,030
the tears you shed for her.

23
00:01:00,930 --> 00:01:02,600
[The rain will stop one day.]

24
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:06,340
[And there will be a time
to wake up from the dream.]

25
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:10,170
Stop lying to yourself.

26
00:01:13,780 --> 00:01:14,920
No matter how...

27
00:01:15,010 --> 00:01:17,340
No matter how realistic
the dreams I've created for you,

28
00:01:17,480 --> 00:01:19,680
no matter how much Hsieh Tien-ti
resembles that woman,

29
00:01:19,980 --> 00:01:21,170
she...

30
00:01:24,210 --> 00:01:25,530
Hsieh Tien-ti

31
00:01:26,010 --> 00:01:27,380
can never be

32
00:01:27,460 --> 00:01:28,610
Tiyamacan whom you dearly loved.

33
00:02:33,940 --> 00:02:35,310
[Will there be a next life]

34
00:02:36,720 --> 00:02:38,040
[after death?]

35
00:02:43,579 --> 00:02:47,100
I wanted to be cool about it and say,

36
00:02:47,940 --> 00:02:49,560
let's meet in our next lives.

37
00:02:51,410 --> 00:02:52,820
I guess that's not possible.

38
00:04:11,660 --> 00:04:12,590
Why?

39
00:04:14,700 --> 00:04:16,200
Why am I overcome with sadness

40
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:21,430
