41
00:04:26,270 --> 00:04:27,590
Tiyamacan.

42
00:04:29,170 --> 00:04:31,370
She's the only woman
Kakarayan has ever loved

43
00:04:31,510 --> 00:04:33,050
in this endless life.

44
00:04:34,850 --> 00:04:36,520
It was why you lied

45
00:04:36,610 --> 00:04:39,290
to yourself and me.

46
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:42,460
It was the reason you made me
create this dream for you.

47
00:04:52,540 --> 00:04:55,530
You know, when you came to me,

48
00:04:57,770 --> 00:04:58,610
you said

49
00:05:00,150 --> 00:05:01,730
that you saw the truth behind everything

50
00:05:04,070 --> 00:05:05,870
in the Reflection of Time.

51
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:16,210
I was so happy

52
00:05:16,300 --> 00:05:17,750
to know you were about to come out

53
00:05:19,730 --> 00:05:21,090
of the lie.

54
00:05:26,060 --> 00:05:27,740
I've waited so long for this day.

55
00:05:34,030 --> 00:05:36,180
I'll finally be able to see you
in your truest form.

56
00:05:41,600 --> 00:05:42,830
But that darn Toem...

57
00:05:45,030 --> 00:05:47,140
She erased the truth that you saw

58
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:51,500
