the Reflection of Time again.

59
00:05:57,300 --> 00:06:00,910
The lie you told deviated from the truth.

60
00:06:02,270 --> 00:06:03,550
That was why I decided

61
00:06:05,710 --> 00:06:06,940
to rearrange the Reflection of Time

62
00:06:07,250 --> 00:06:09,450
for the sake of your lie.

63
00:06:10,940 --> 00:06:13,190
It was so that you could get closer
to the truth again

64
00:06:13,670 --> 00:06:15,960
and free yourself from the lie.

65
00:06:16,660 --> 00:06:21,020
The things that I dreamed of

66
00:06:21,550 --> 00:06:27,930
will become the paths you take.

67
00:06:28,010 --> 00:06:29,030
[In order to make sure]

68
00:06:29,160 --> 00:06:30,170
[your lie fully believed]

69
00:06:30,260 --> 00:06:31,620
in the Reflection of Time
I arranged for him,

70
00:06:31,710 --> 00:06:34,170
I even made him be like you.

71
00:06:35,100 --> 00:06:36,900
I made him fall in love with Tiyamacan

72
00:06:37,340 --> 00:06:38,180
and fall in love

73
00:06:38,270 --> 00:06:40,420
with the girl
who could expose him as the lie.

74
00:06:41,790 --> 00:06:42,970
[Because I know]

75
00:06:43,900 --> 00:06:44,640
[that only when a person]

76
00:06:44,730 --> 00:06:46,490
[falls in love with another]

77
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:48,780
[can he truly believe]

78
00:06:48,909 --> 00:06:50,280
[that what he sees before him]

79
00:06:50,409 --> 00:06:51,600
[is real.]

80
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:54,150
So at the same time,

81
00:06:56,610 --> 00:06:58,280
[I tried everything]

82
00:06:58,420 --> 00:07:00,000
[to let the girl]

83
00:07:00,090 --> 00:07:02,020
[fall in love with the lie you made up.]

84
00:07:07,880 --> 00:07:08,890
What should I do?

85
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:12,940
I think I like you.

86
00:07:14,650 --> 00:07:15,930
[So...]

87
00:07:17,600 --> 00:07:19,450
Hsieh Tien-ti falling in love with me

88
00:07:20,200 --> 00:07:22,350
and me falling in love with her

89
00:07:23,850 --> 00:07:25,920
were all parts of your plan.

90
00:07:27,850 --> 00:07:31,280
Yes, I arranged everything.

91
00:07:31,850 --> 00:07:33,700
There was a reason why I let Toem live

92
00:07:33,790 --> 00:07:34,980
instead of getting rid of her.

93
00:07:35,860 --> 00:07:37,490
I needed her

94
00:07:37,620 --> 00:07:39,330
to harm Hsieh Tien-ti

95
00:07:39,420 --> 00:07:43,430
