more determined to protect her.

96
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:49,409
When I thought I was doing all these

97
00:07:50,200 --> 00:07:51,610
to help pull you out

98
00:07:51,700 --> 00:07:53,190
from the lie,

99
00:07:53,280 --> 00:07:54,340
I realized

100
00:07:54,470 --> 00:07:57,330
that the person living in the lie
wasn't you,

101
00:07:57,460 --> 00:07:58,740
but me!

102
00:07:59,620 --> 00:08:01,990
Cry if you want to.

103
00:08:19,330 --> 00:08:21,440
[When I watched that girl grow up,]

104
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:24,170
[she resembled Ticamayan]

105
00:08:24,260 --> 00:08:25,930
[more and more.]

106
00:08:26,370 --> 00:08:28,130
That was when I realized

107
00:08:30,990 --> 00:08:33,320
everything that happened

108
00:08:33,409 --> 00:08:35,390
has always been part of your plan.

109
00:08:36,090 --> 00:08:37,809
It has never changed.

110
00:08:37,900 --> 00:08:39,440
Since thousands of years ago,

111
00:08:40,100 --> 00:08:41,330
when you made up a lie

112
00:08:41,940 --> 00:08:42,909
to deceive yourself,

113
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:44,670
have a messenger represent you,

114
00:08:44,760 --> 00:08:46,740
and have me create this dream for you,

115
00:08:48,100 --> 00:08:49,950
you let me stay in this world alone

116
00:08:50,040 --> 00:08:51,010
while waiting for you to come back

117
00:08:51,100 --> 00:08:52,640
because this is the moment
you've been waiting for.

118
00:08:53,820 --> 00:08:54,700
This moment

119
00:08:55,280 --> 00:08:57,080
where you can hide behind the lie

120
00:08:57,170 --> 00:08:58,090
and be with the girl

121
00:08:58,180 --> 00:08:59,670
who looks like Tiyamacan,

122
00:08:59,760 --> 00:09:02,710
living in the dream I weaved for you

123
00:09:05,220 --> 00:09:06,710
while being deeply in love
with each other.

124
00:09:08,120 --> 00:09:08,780
You made me realize

125
00:09:08,870 --> 00:09:10,810
that impossible dream.

126
00:09:11,250 --> 00:09:12,350
Kakarayan.

127
00:09:12,700 --> 00:09:14,680
You need to wake up!

128
00:09:16,220 --> 00:09:17,760
I really couldn't...

129
00:09:18,070 --> 00:09:19,740
I couldn't let you

130
00:09:20,220 --> 00:09:22,330
continue to dwell in the lie.

131
00:09:25,280 --> 00:09:26,690
That was why at that time,

132
00:09:28,050 --> 00:09:29,640
I erased all the memories

133
00:09:29,730 --> 00:09:32,670
Hsieh Tien-ti had of you.

134
00:09:45,700 --> 00:09:49,440
From now on, you'll forget

135
00:09:50,760 --> 00:09:52,560
everything about that person.

136
00:09:53,260 --> 00:09:54,140
To get you out

137
00:09:54,230 --> 00:09:56,780
of the fake reality,

138
00:09:57,800 --> 00:10:00,660
I had to sacrifice

139
00:10:00,740 --> 00:10:02,370
all the Kawas you created

140
00:10:02,500 --> 00:10:04,400
for the sake of blessing this world.

141
00:10:12,230 --> 00:10:13,420
I can't accept it.

142
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:16,320
I can't accept it.

143
00:10:16,410 --> 00:10:17,380
I want you to watch

144
00:10:17,460 --> 00:10:18,170
Hsieh Tien-ti,

145
00:10:18,260 --> 00:10:20,150
the girl who looks like Ticamayan die.

146
00:10:31,940 --> 00:10:33,390
[Why?]

147
00:10:33,480 --> 00:10:35,720
Why won't you wake up?

148
00:10:36,380 --> 00:10:38,930
Why do you hide behind the lie?

149
00:10:39,460 --> 00:10:40,960
Why do you insist on

150
00:10:41,050 --> 00:10:42,280
destroying this world

151
00:10:42,410 --> 00:10:44,740
we had built together?

152
00:10:44,830 --> 00:10:46,500
What should I do?

153
00:10:46,810 --> 00:10:47,910
What should I do

154
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:48,830
to make you see

155
00:10:48,920 --> 00:10:49,800
that Tiyamacan

156
00:10:49,890 --> 00:10:51,910
won't appear in front of you again?

157
00:11:06,960 --> 00:11:10,170
'Orad, face the reality.

158
00:11:13,960 --> 00:11:15,190
From the very beginning,

159
00:11:18,880 --> 00:11:20,340
you were just a lie

160
00:11:21,480 --> 00:11:23,150
that Kakarayan had made up

161
00:11:23,280 --> 00:11:25,220
to make up for His regret.

162
00:12:02,880 --> 00:12:04,030
It's too late.

163
00:12:04,110 --> 00:12:05,480
You can vanish

164
00:12:05,610 --> 00:12:06,800
along with the lie you want to protect.

165
00:12:06,930 --> 00:12:08,120
'Orad!

166
00:12:43,620 --> 00:12:44,680
Kakarayan.

167
00:12:52,560 --> 00:12:54,320
Your lie is gone.

168
00:12:57,620 --> 00:12:58,850
You don't have to hide anymore.

169
00:13:03,510 --> 00:13:05,230
Come back to me now.

170
00:13:56,490 --> 00:13:58,330
Don't tell me you thought I was Kakarayan.

171
00:14:00,710 --> 00:14:02,160
You're too naive.

172
00:14:02,730 --> 00:14:05,460
Why would He be in the heart of a Kariah?

173
00:14:10,960 --> 00:14:12,240
Haven't you noticed?

174
00:14:13,380 --> 00:14:15,400
From the moment you saw me,

175
00:14:15,490 --> 00:14:17,250
you've already been locked up

176
00:14:17,340 --> 00:14:18,570
in my heart.

177
00:14:53,820 --> 00:14:55,140
I'll leave the rest to you.

178
00:15:36,230 --> 00:15:38,210
['Orad would disappear]

179
00:15:39,050 --> 00:15:40,760
because he would find out

180
00:15:40,980 --> 00:15:41,900
that he was a lie

181
00:15:41,990 --> 00:15:44,060
that never actually existed
from the Reflection of Time.

182
00:15:44,630 --> 00:15:45,820
But that would be because

183
00:15:46,570 --> 00:15:47,760
he hadn't experienced

184
00:15:47,840 --> 00:15:49,780
the moments spent with you yet.

185
00:15:51,010 --> 00:15:51,760
I believe

186
00:15:51,850 --> 00:15:54,000
that when he has experienced it,

187
00:15:54,090 --> 00:15:55,150
it won't be so easy

188
00:15:55,240 --> 00:15:56,690
for him to deny his own existence.

189
00:16:01,790 --> 00:16:04,610
Please make him forget
that he's just a lie.

190
00:16:05,220 --> 00:16:06,150
Tell him

191
00:16:06,370 --> 00:16:08,520
you are the reason for his existence.

192
00:16:09,270 --> 00:16:10,680
Do it for me.

193
00:16:10,770 --> 00:16:12,310
Stay with him.

194
00:16:13,010 --> 00:16:14,070
[Protect him.]

195
00:16:26,910 --> 00:16:30,390
[Do you know your name?]

196
00:16:31,490 --> 00:16:33,470
[What is my name?]

197
00:16:34,440 --> 00:16:37,340
[Your name is Toem.]

198
00:16:38,750 --> 00:16:39,980
[Toem.]

199
00:16:40,290 --> 00:16:43,020
[Yes. From now on,]

200
00:16:43,550 --> 00:16:46,410
[you are the Kawas
in charge of the clouds.]

201
00:16:47,330 --> 00:16:49,090
[Remember what I say.]

202
00:16:49,440 --> 00:16:52,350
[Protect everyone's]

203
00:16:52,480 --> 00:16:53,840
[spoken lies]

204
00:16:54,410 --> 00:16:57,890
[and every wish
that's never realized in time.]

205
00:17:06,819 --> 00:17:07,569
'Orad.

206
00:17:19,180 --> 00:17:21,430
From now on,

207
00:17:23,720 --> 00:17:25,170
you will...

208
00:17:35,330 --> 00:17:36,260
No.

209
00:17:37,750 --> 00:17:38,540
I can't let you

210
00:17:38,630 --> 00:17:40,520
keep living in another lie.

211
00:17:42,640 --> 00:17:44,260
Whether it is Kakarayan's lie

212
00:17:44,400 --> 00:17:45,890
or Fali's,

213
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:50,560
no matter how much I want you to stay,

214
00:17:52,140 --> 00:17:53,500
you're not just a lie.

215
00:18:03,580 --> 00:18:07,360
Because I remember.

216
00:18:09,120 --> 00:18:10,130
When I was young

217
00:18:12,160 --> 00:18:15,020
and Grandma sent me off to Aunt Su-chen's,

218
00:18:16,160 --> 00:18:17,440
I didn't know

219
00:18:18,100 --> 00:18:20,030
[what to do all by myself.]

220
00:18:20,170 --> 00:18:23,860
[It was you who tapped my head]

221
00:18:26,680 --> 00:18:29,050
[and told me not to be afraid.]

222
00:18:32,440 --> 00:18:34,820
[Because no matter what happens,]

223
00:18:35,390 --> 00:18:37,630
[you'll always be by my side.]

224
00:18:42,380 --> 00:18:44,760
No matter what difficult things
happened to me,

225
00:18:45,730 --> 00:18:50,130
you were by my side every time.

226
00:18:50,220 --> 00:18:51,620
You would tell me

227
00:18:53,520 --> 00:18:55,360
[not to be sad]

228
00:18:56,550 --> 00:18:58,400
and that no matter what happened,

229
00:18:58,970 --> 00:19:00,600
you would be there with me.

230
00:19:05,970 --> 00:19:06,940
And...

231
00:19:07,820 --> 00:19:09,530
at my first interview

232
00:19:10,370 --> 00:19:14,020
and the first time I led a tour,

233
00:19:14,110 --> 00:19:23,000
[Mountain Travel]

234
00:19:14,110 --> 00:19:17,230
[I was scared and worried.]

235
00:19:27,130 --> 00:19:29,510
[Whenever I felt overwhelmed,]

236
00:19:29,590 --> 00:19:31,880
[you always appeared before me.]

237
00:19:31,220 --> 00:19:33,510
[Mountain Travel]

238
00:19:37,950 --> 00:19:40,150
Just like every rainfall you gave me

239
00:19:40,240 --> 00:19:42,490
over the past 20 years.

240
00:19:44,380 --> 00:19:45,790
I'm sorry.

241
00:19:45,920 --> 00:19:47,940
I was held up in a meeting.

242
00:19:49,530 --> 00:19:50,670
Why don't you guys start first?

243
00:19:50,760 --> 00:19:51,730
I'll be right there.

244
00:19:52,080 --> 00:19:53,660
Okay. I'm sorry.

245
00:19:53,750 --> 00:19:55,160
Okay, thank you.

246
00:19:56,350 --> 00:19:57,530
You don't have to rush.

247
00:19:57,620 --> 00:19:59,600
It's not that important anyway.

248
00:20:00,220 --> 00:20:01,490
What do you mean it's not important?

249
00:20:01,580 --> 00:20:03,300
Ms. Chang-fen said I have to be there.

250
00:20:09,900 --> 00:20:11,700
It's raining a lot over there too.

251
00:20:12,100 --> 00:20:14,300
And it will continue for a few hours.

252
00:20:15,840 --> 00:20:17,600
It looks like the event won't happen.

253
00:20:19,750 --> 00:20:20,680
What should I do then?

254
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:36,470
[No matter how unreasonable the rain was,]

255
00:20:38,060 --> 00:20:39,900
[you're my guardian angel.]

256
00:20:40,040 --> 00:20:41,400
[This...]

257
00:20:41,800 --> 00:20:43,690
can't be fake.

258
00:20:46,150 --> 00:20:46,860
Because...

259
00:20:49,010 --> 00:20:50,680
no matter what happens,

260
00:20:52,360 --> 00:20:53,280
you will...

261
00:20:53,810 --> 00:20:55,610
I'll be by your side.

262
00:21:00,580 --> 00:21:01,730
I'll be by your side.

263
00:21:04,280 --> 00:21:05,990
No matter what happens,

264
00:21:06,080 --> 00:21:08,110
you're always by my side.

265
00:21:18,800 --> 00:21:20,510
Like right now.

266
00:21:22,320 --> 00:21:24,030
[When you're holding my hand,]

267
00:21:24,560 --> 00:21:28,920
[your hands feel warm.]

268
00:21:29,050 --> 00:21:32,130
[I can feel your warmth.]

269
00:21:32,880 --> 00:21:34,290
There's no way...

270
00:21:34,900 --> 00:21:37,010
There's no way you're fake.

271
00:21:38,910 --> 00:21:41,850
How can you be a lie?

272
00:22:00,160 --> 00:22:01,210
Are you scared?

273
00:22:07,720 --> 00:22:10,320
It's an honor

274
00:22:10,410 --> 00:22:12,040
to disappear together with you

275
00:22:12,170 --> 00:22:13,970
and all the Kawas in Pinokayan.

276
00:22:14,630 --> 00:22:15,780
What's there to be scared of?

277
00:22:20,530 --> 00:22:22,020
Then let me tell you a story

278
00:22:22,460 --> 00:22:23,870
before you disappear.

279
00:22:26,380 --> 00:22:27,390
What story?

280
00:22:29,240 --> 00:22:31,000
Before the world came to be,

281
00:22:32,140 --> 00:22:34,170
it was just a chaotic mess.

282
00:22:34,250 --> 00:22:35,050
There was nothing.

283
00:22:35,930 --> 00:22:37,330
There was only Kakarayan,

284
00:22:40,370 --> 00:22:43,140
the only lonely god.

285
00:22:45,520 --> 00:22:47,670
To not feel lonely,

286
00:22:49,700 --> 00:22:51,900
He created the first Kawas

287
00:22:52,690 --> 00:22:54,630
in this world of nothingness.

288
00:22:57,880 --> 00:22:59,600
He gave him a name.

289
00:23:02,240 --> 00:23:03,210
Lemed.

290
00:23:06,770 --> 00:23:07,740
Lemed.

291
00:23:09,450 --> 00:23:10,550
The god of dreams.

292
00:23:11,870 --> 00:23:14,250
The Kawas that controls all dreams.

293
00:23:16,100 --> 00:23:18,560
Kakarayan then used Lemed's power

294
00:23:19,180 --> 00:23:20,980
to create a beautiful dream

295
00:23:22,960 --> 00:23:25,470
in this world of nothingness.

296
00:23:26,740 --> 00:23:28,020
A dream

297
00:23:28,720 --> 00:23:31,540
that contains all his hopes.

298
00:23:34,360 --> 00:23:35,590
And this dream

299
00:23:39,150 --> 00:23:41,310
is the world you were born into.

300
00:23:44,520 --> 00:23:45,930
In the dream,

301
00:23:46,020 --> 00:23:46,900
Kakarayan fell in love

302
00:23:46,980 --> 00:23:48,170
with a woman named Tiyamacan.

303
00:23:49,180 --> 00:23:51,250
He wouldn't listen to Lemed's caution

304
00:23:52,000 --> 00:23:53,190
and wanted nothing more

305
00:23:54,020 --> 00:23:55,390
than to be with Tiyamacan

306
00:23:55,520 --> 00:23:57,190
and live together in reality.

307
00:23:58,200 --> 00:24:00,890
Create a real world that belonged to them.

308
00:24:06,170 --> 00:24:07,310
But He forgot.

309
00:24:08,890 --> 00:24:09,860
Tiyamacan

310
00:24:09,990 --> 00:24:12,020
was a woman from the dream after all.

311
00:24:13,160 --> 00:24:15,710
When Kakarayan woke up

312
00:24:16,110 --> 00:24:17,560
from the dream with Tiyamacan

313
00:24:18,130 --> 00:24:20,600
and returned to the real world,

314
00:24:26,190 --> 00:24:27,070
she...

315
00:24:29,090 --> 00:24:30,940
vanished before His eyes.

316
00:24:33,620 --> 00:24:35,430
Why are you

317
00:24:35,870 --> 00:24:36,880
telling me this story now?

318
00:24:40,620 --> 00:24:42,200
In this story,

319
00:24:44,140 --> 00:24:46,780
the Kawas that shared
the dream with Kakarayan...

320
00:24:51,350 --> 00:24:52,540
I am Lemed.

321
00:24:54,430 --> 00:24:56,850
The Comb of Memories you got from me

322
00:24:57,950 --> 00:24:58,960
was known

323
00:24:59,270 --> 00:25:00,680
as the Comb of Dreams in the past.

324
00:25:04,330 --> 00:25:07,240
More importantly,
there's something I want to tell you.

325
00:25:07,760 --> 00:25:10,230
The world that you think is real

326
00:25:13,480 --> 00:25:15,600
is merely Kakarayan's dream.

327
00:25:20,080 --> 00:25:21,890
So the door

328
00:25:22,370 --> 00:25:23,600
that I and all the Kawas went through

329
00:25:24,660 --> 00:25:26,590
doesn't lead to Pinokayan.

330
00:25:29,370 --> 00:25:30,330
That's right.

331
00:25:34,470 --> 00:25:36,270
The door you passed through

332
00:25:36,890 --> 00:25:38,210
is the path

333
00:25:38,300 --> 00:25:40,370
leading to Kakarayan's real world.

334
00:25:41,730 --> 00:25:42,920
Kawas like you

335
00:25:43,530 --> 00:25:46,040
who were created in the dream

336
00:25:46,350 --> 00:25:48,860
can't survive in the real world.

337
00:25:50,400 --> 00:25:52,470
Only the Kawas that were created

338
00:25:52,550 --> 00:25:54,490
in Kakarayan's real world...

339
00:26:01,660 --> 00:26:02,810
Only I...

340
00:26:04,960 --> 00:26:06,020
can exist.

341
00:26:34,790 --> 00:26:37,170
'Orad, look at our rings.

342
00:26:39,760 --> 00:26:42,580
Do you remember I asked you once?

343
00:26:43,640 --> 00:26:45,350
You put this ring on me

344
00:26:45,440 --> 00:26:46,980
when I was little.

345
00:26:47,110 --> 00:26:49,090
Why am I still able to wear it

346
00:26:49,180 --> 00:26:50,760
now that I'm all grown up?

347
00:26:50,850 --> 00:26:53,490
Do you remember what you answered me?

348
00:26:55,160 --> 00:26:58,950
Because it's not an ordinary ring.

349
00:27:01,590 --> 00:27:03,040
It's a promise between us.

350
00:27:06,470 --> 00:27:07,830
What promise?

351
00:27:10,650 --> 00:27:12,940
As long as I'm your guardian angel,

352
00:27:14,830 --> 00:27:17,160
the rings will always be on our fingers.

353
00:27:30,230 --> 00:27:32,520
Why does that sound so familiar?

354
00:27:34,280 --> 00:27:35,110
It was already said

355
00:27:35,200 --> 00:27:36,170
when I erased your memory

356
00:27:36,260 --> 00:27:37,930
for the first time, wasn't it?

357
00:27:38,680 --> 00:27:40,130
Now,

358
00:27:40,220 --> 00:27:42,280
you'll once again be able to see
the Reflection of Time.

359
00:27:43,080 --> 00:27:44,660
In the Reflection of Time,

360
00:27:44,970 --> 00:27:47,260
you'll fall in love
with the person you must protect.

361
00:27:48,000 --> 00:27:49,720
As you make the vow with her,

362
00:27:52,540 --> 00:27:54,740
you'll put this ring on her finger.

363
00:27:56,540 --> 00:27:58,080
After that,

364
00:27:58,830 --> 00:28:00,720
while spending each day with her,

365
00:28:00,810 --> 00:28:02,920
you'll slowly and gradually

366
00:28:05,250 --> 00:28:10,620
fall in love with this person
you're meant to protect.

367
00:28:13,520 --> 00:28:16,120
As long as she has this ring,

368
00:28:17,000 --> 00:28:21,000
you won't forget
the promise you made to her.

369
00:28:21,400 --> 00:28:23,730
You'll always be by her side.

370
00:28:23,860 --> 00:28:28,130
You'll be constantly thinking of her
and protecting her.

371
00:28:28,660 --> 00:28:30,460
And you'll be deeply in love with her.

372
00:28:33,150 --> 00:28:34,160
'Orad.

373
00:28:35,080 --> 00:28:36,750
Whether you like it or not,

374
00:28:37,630 --> 00:28:40,850
everything you believe in and love

375
00:28:42,340 --> 00:28:45,200
is all a lie!

376
00:29:38,130 --> 00:29:39,670
[When a lie is found out]

377
00:29:38,570 --> 00:30:08,890
[Next episode]

378
00:29:39,890 --> 00:29:41,650
[and no one is willing
to believe it anymore,]

379
00:29:41,780 --> 00:29:43,590
[how do you expect it
to continue to exist?]

380
00:29:43,720 --> 00:29:45,960
[Is this the answer
you're giving yourself]

381
00:29:46,360 --> 00:29:48,080
[after everything you've been through?]

382
00:29:48,560 --> 00:29:50,060
[You'll forget]

383
00:29:51,330 --> 00:29:53,880
[that 'Orad said he was a lie]

384
00:29:54,670 --> 00:29:56,570
[and how all the Reflections of Time
you saw]

385
00:29:56,700 --> 00:29:58,240
[were nightmares.]

386
00:29:59,510 --> 00:30:00,660
[You have to believe]

387
00:30:00,750 --> 00:30:02,640
[that he has always been by your side.]

388
00:30:03,390 --> 00:30:05,500
[He never left.]

389
00:30:06,030 --> 00:30:07,740
He has been protecting you.

390
00:30:09,940 --> 00:30:16,320
[It was you]
